## New split screens checklist

1. Extract client-only split component; `dynamic` + skeleton.
2. Set `minSize` / `maxSize` with correct **px vs `%`** types.
3. Group `height: auto`; panel `overflow-visible! max-h-none!` if page must scroll.
4. Sanitize persisted layout; sensible default percent layout.
5. Update `document/knowledge/frontend.md` when shipping production behavior.
6. Segment `loading.tsx` skeleton matches split chrome ([`skeleton.mdc`](skeleton.mdc)).
